<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Outback Steakhouse cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Outback Steakhouse cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter cut its rating on Outback Steakhouse Inc to neutral from buy, a Dean Witter source said.</p>
<p>-- Outback Steakhouse lost 1-3/8 to 24-1/2 in early morning trading.</p>
<p>-- On Friday, Outback Steakhouse said the company told analysts its same-store sales fell 3.2 percent in December.</p>
</text>
